WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The same order arrives three times and is processed once.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Architecture: Architecture.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Duplicate delivery and a lost acknowledgement: two of three deliveries are recognised as duplicates.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Two transient 503 errors are retried; the third attempt succeeds.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A malformed message goes straight to the poison queue.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A message that fails on every attempt is moved to poison after five dequeues.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The ledger holds exactly one entry per order.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Verified result. Source, tests and setup steps are linked below.
